          "id": 2724596578,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Why pass a tvb including the fixed tag (which is fixed for everything in this table) and the length (which is used to set the tvb reported length and thus the dissector handle in the table can obtain) instead of starting with the tag extension?",
