        {
          "id": 2724640169,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "For parsing the ISO extended descriptors, the length byte is important (to verify consistency). For this reason I wanted to pass it along. But you make a valid point that this length can be requested from a subset tvb that spans the correct length. This will also avoid the ugly offset adjustments. I will rework the code to improve this.",
