      "title": "mpeg: add dissector table for PMT extended descriptors",
      "message": "mpeg: add dissector table for PMT extended descriptors\n\nThis commit adds to the MPEG TS (ISO/IEC 13818-1 | Rec. ITU-T H.222.0)\nprotocol a new dissector table \"mpeg_descr.iso_ext.tag\" to allow further\ndissection of ISO Extension descriptors (tag == 0x3F) in the PMT. This\nis similar to the \"mpeg-pes.stream\" dissector table and complements the\nexisting MPEG TS protocol dissectors.\n",
      "author_name": "Tim Bruylants",
      "author_email": "t.bruylants@intopix.com",
      "authored_date": "2025-09-02T16:53:00.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "AndersBroman",
      "committer_email": "a.broman58@gmail.com",
